TactileSim
Copyright 2026 SO-101 MuJoCo Tactile contributors.

The lumped tactile mechanics, sensor interface and Velostat readout originated
in TactileSim work attributed to Arik in the source workspace, and were adapted
and integrated by the SO-101 MuJoCo Tactile contributors. This branch further
modifies their parameters, validation, interfaces and packaging.

OpenTac-CAD (formerly OpenTactileCAD) defines the sensor manifest conventions used by the loader.
Packaged signal profiles retain their original calibration-source metadata.

Elastic nodal-force assembly follows MuJoCo 3.12's mj_flexPassiveStretch in
src/engine/engine_passive.c, Copyright DeepMind Technologies Limited,
licensed under Apache-2.0: https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco.
